  sequence:
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b3ee503276706114e8c69bcd1fbcb4d7, type: 3}
    clearBackground: 0
    speakerName: Haruko
    dialogue:
    - What's so hard to understand!? You just put the numbers into the equation like
      that!
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    clearBackground: 0
    speakerName: Katsuko
    dialogue:
    - Uh... Mhm... Right... You're not very good at explaining things, Haruko.
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    clearBackground: 0
    speakerName: Haruko
    dialogue:
    - Have you been listening to a single word I've been saying!?
    - Alright, you know what? I'll come back to you later.
    - Mitsuko! Let's go over another problem!
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    clearBackground: 0
    speakerName: Mitsuko
    dialogue:
    - Oh... R-right!
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    clearBackground: 0
    speakerName: Katsuko
    dialogue:
    - (Geez... Even at home I can't escape the nagging...)
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    clearBackground: 0
    speakerName: Haruko
    dialogue:
    - What was that!?
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    clearBackground: 0
    speakerName: Katsuko
    dialogue:
    - I don't know what you're talking about.
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    clearBackground: 1
    speakerName: Ryuuji
    dialogue:
    - (I better not bother them during their study session...)
  alternateSequences: []
